&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we build simple, affordable financial tools that empower over 4 million small businesses worldwide to get paid, manage their money, and thrive. We are a global team of 3,000+ people across 20+ offices and 90+ nationalities, all dedicated to supporting merchants with excellent products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Talent Acquisition team, we don&#39;t just fill seats. We care deeply about hiring excellence and finding people who truly elevate our teams. For us, recruitment is a team sport - we win together, constantly looking at how we can improve and bounce ideas off each other, and always step in to help whenever someone gets stuck or hits a wall.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our&lt;strong&gt; Consumer Mission &lt;/strong&gt;- building the &lt;a href=&quot;https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.sumup.pay&amp;amp;hl=en&quot;&gt;SumUp App&lt;/a&gt; - is scaling fast and we’re looking for a Senior Tech TA Partner to help the team navigate London’s hyper-competitive market, where top engineers are in high demand.Your superpower will be understanding how to position SumUp&#39;s massive scale and impact to passive talent. Operating as a true talent advisor, you will own hiring across Engineering, Product, Data, and Design (EP&amp;amp;D) for the Consumer portfolio, scaling the technical teams responsible for turning SumUp into a leading financial services platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full-cycle hiring journey for complex roles across Engineering, Product, Design, Data and some commerical role for the Consumer tribe, maintaining a consistently high talent bar as we scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted, embedded relationships with Consumer leadership. You’ll serve as a proactive advisor rather than a reactive coordinator - running regular hiring cadences, maintaining pipeline visibility, and providing market-led recommendations on role prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at identifying, engaging, and closing high-caliber passive tech talent in the London market, knowing how to articulate our technical challenges and unique value proposition effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze funnel health metrics across your portfolio to surface blockers, challenge hiring assumptions, optimize sourcing efforts, and provide stakeholders with clear, honest pipeline updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an inclusive hiring process that guarantees an exceptional experience for candidates and hiring teams alike, ensuring we stand out in a crowded market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of managing full-cycle talent acquisition for Engineering, Product, Data, and Design and Commercial roles within fast-moving tech or fintech environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a deep understanding of the London and broader UK tech landscape, with a knack for mapping talent pools and knowing what it takes to attract and win over high-demand, engineering talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate as a trusted business partner rather than just executing briefs - confidently managing multi-stakeholder portfolios, advising hiring managers on market realities, and expertly guiding interview calibration and debriefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a data-first mindset, using funnel analytics and recruiting metrics to identify what’s working, track pipeline efficiency, and clearly influence stakeholder decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a genuine care for candidate experience, bringing empathy and transparency to every stage of the hiring journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note: We are unable to offer visa sponsorship for this role. You must have the right to work in the UK to be considered.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our central Covent Garden location, wrapped in historic charm and modern flair. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health matters: private health insurance, including optical and dental&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: retirement scheme (SumUp matches 7% when you contribute 5%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡 Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in our diverse team of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. Our core values lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our careers website, and follow our journey on LinkedIn, Instagram, and TikTok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is best known for helping small businesses get paid — our Consumer tribe builds the other half of that story. We make SumUp Consumer, the wallet app that lets everyday consumers pay SumUp merchants with a tap, send money to friends, track their spending and earn loyalty rewards along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we grow SumUp Consumer across new markets and features, we need sharp, reliable insight into how people discover, adopt and use the product — and how that behaviour translates into sustainable commercial growth. This includes understanding our acquisition funnel, improving activation and conversion, increasing customer value, and reducing churn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Data Analyst to join the Consumer tribe and become the analytical partner for SumUp Consumer. You’ll work closely with Product Managers, Designers and Engineers, alongside our Analytics Engineering team, to understand customer behaviour, shape product strategy, and connect product performance to business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help answer questions such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Which acquisition channels and customer segments generate the strongest long-term value?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where do customers drop out of the journey from acquisition to activation?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What drives repeat usage, retention and churn?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Which product changes improve conversion, customer value or commercial performance?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How should we prioritise product investments across markets and customer segments?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by meaningful analytical work, enjoy translating complexity into clarity, and want to see your insights directly influence both product decisions and commercial outcomes, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer behaviour and product performance across the full consumer lifecycle — from &lt;strong&gt;acquisition and activation through engagement, retention, churn and reactivation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion, customer value and sustainable growth using funnel analysis, cohort analysis, segmentation and behavioural analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product Managers, Designers, Engineers and Data teams to ensure decisions are grounded in robust analysis, customer insight and commercial understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the performance of customer segments, markets, channels and product journeys, helping the team understand where growth opportunities and commercial trade-offs exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support decisions that improve key business outcomes, such as activation, conversion, repeat usage, retention, churn, customer lifetime value and revenue-related metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct exploratory analysis to answer product and business questions, translating complex data into clear, commercially relevant recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, monitor and communicate core SumUp Consumer KPIs, covering acquisition, activation, engagement, conversion, retention, churn and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, execute and analyse A/B tests and product experiments, assessing both customer impact and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and reporting that stakeholders actively use, proactively surfacing trends, anomalies, performance risks and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help Product Managers assess the expected impact of opportunities and evaluate whether product investments are delivering the intended customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics Engineering to ensure KPI definitions, business logic and product instrumentation are accurate, scalable and trusted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a curious eye to AI and machine learning techniques, including LLM-assisted analysis, to speed up insight generation, customer understanding and product measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong SQL skills and are comfortable querying, analysing and validating data in a cloud data warehouse such as Snowflake, BigQuery or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with product analytics techniques such as funnel analysis, cohort analysis, segmentation and behavioural analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the commercial drivers of a digital product, including customer acquisition, conversion, activation, retention, churn and customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can connect customer behaviour and product performance to business outcomes, and use data to identify growth opportunities and inform prioritisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked on A/B tests or product experiments, with a solid grounding in the statistics behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re proficient in a visualisation tool such as Looker, Tableau or Power BI, with a track record of building dashboards that stakeholders actually use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can translate ambiguous product or business questions into structured analysis, and explain findings clearly to technical and non-technical audiences alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable assessing trade-offs, challenging assumptions and making recommendations based on evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about how AI and emerging techniques can improve product measurement, experimentation, customer understanding and commercial decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable managing multiple workstreams and stakeholders, with strong prioritisation and a proactive communication style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role does not support Visa sponsorship and candidates must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our central London Bridge location, wrapped in historic charm and modern flair. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health matters: private health insurance, including optical and dental&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: retirement scheme (SumUp matches 7% when you contribute 5%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡 Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in our diverse team of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. Our core values lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our careers website, and follow our journey on LinkedIn, Instagram, and TikTok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Senior Software Engineer II&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Team: Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are the architects of the human data infrastructure that&#39;s reshaping the landscape of AI development. In a world where foundational AI technologies are increasingly commoditized, it&#39;s the quality and diversity of human-generated data that truly differentiates products and models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;548&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer II, you will play a pivotal role in driving technical excellence across one of our product development teams. You will lead the technical direction of projects, ensuring the delivery of scalable, secure, and high-quality solutions, while providing guidance, mentorship, and support to engineers across the team. The role may also include line management responsibilities for less experienced team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Technical Projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Oversee the design and implementation of key projects, delivering innovative solutions that align with business goals and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with Product Managers and other stakeholders to define project scope, timelines, and resources, providing expert technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Engineering Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;: Create high-quality, efficient code, uphold coding standards through code reviews and contribute to strategic initiatives and standards through the Technical Authority Group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and Develop Team Members&lt;/strong&gt;: Foster a collaborative and inclusive team environment, mentoring others and assisting in hiring and onboarding new talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence Technical Direction&lt;/strong&gt;: Play a key role in strategic technical decisions, promoting the adoption of new technologies and processes to enhance product functionality and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;: Take responsibility for products and features developed by the team, ensuring successful deployment and ongoing support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive Technical Leadership Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven experience in technical leadership or senior software development roles with strong problem-solving and strategic thinking skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Extensive experience with Python and cloud based environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; A product engineering mindset and focus on business impacts of technical efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent Communication Skills&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to lead diverse teams and collaborate effectively with various stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Methodologies Familiarity&lt;/strong&gt;: Knowledge of agile practices and project management techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Key Technologies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We ask for expertise in some, and the willingness to learn where required&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;: AWS and GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Languages&lt;/strong&gt;: Python, JavaScript, and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;: Vue.js, Django Rest Framework, Container-based and Serverless architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Databases&lt;/strong&gt;: MongoDB and DynamoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevOps and Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; CircleCI, GitHub Actions, Kubernetes, Celery, EventBridge and DataDog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Prolific is a great place to work&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioral data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won&#39;t come solely from scaling existing models, but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviors into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation – one that reflects the breath and the best of humanity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working for us will place you at the forefront of AI innovation, providing access to our unique human data platform and opportunities for groundbreaking research. Join us to enjoy a competitive salary, benefits, and remote working within our impactful, mission-driven culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Links to more information on Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
