&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Lead Product Designer at FanDuel, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;you are a trusted design leader&amp;nbsp;responsible for&amp;nbsp;raising design quality and driving meaningful&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;impact across multiple teams or product areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You combine exceptional craft, strategic thinking, systems design, customer insight, and cross-functional leadership to solve complex customer and business problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;While&amp;nbsp;remaining&amp;nbsp;hands-on, your impact extends&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;elevating the work of others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;improve&amp;nbsp;ways of working, influence product&amp;nbsp;direction, strengthen design systems and practices,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and help teams consistently deliver exceptional customer experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You are expected to&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;with a high degree of autonomy, navigate ambiguity confidently, build alignment across disciplines, and consistently elevate the quality of both products and the design organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
